                                "sense_id": "097e98fe-fd76-3b81-af26-d4e269393f28",
                                "text": "How dared that miserable wretch cast his eye—his cock[-]eye, as Vroom had truly said—on Etta. It gave him a kind of grim pleasure to dwell on Looten's physical defect."
