                                "sense_id": "097e98fe-fd76-3b81-af26-d4e269393f28",
                                "text": "The next time I saw Dave, he'd joined Deep Purple and had just got back from Sweden, where the band had sent their new lead singer to have his cock-eye straightened."
                            },
