                                "example_id": "59389514-577d-459a-8547-26c54f401edf",
                                "sense_id": "097e98fe-fd76-3b81-af26-d4e269393f28",
                                "text": "His cockeye ogled the pile of food sitting on the table. “Delicious!” he said with glee. The cockeyed cricket licked his lips […]"
                            },
